  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="75df610a-f1b4-58d3-8c46-19de0f0857b5" activityNameId="bf8a053e-ca5f-5907-bee8-06dd7af4abc1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Hay intensive IP, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Hay intensive IP, at farm
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of barn-dried hay from intensive integrated production. The net dry matter yield is 11603 kg/ha.;
UUID: 1a708f5a-094b-3f1b-a071-593baef3773e
The inventories include the cultivation of hay on a permanent meadow. Included steps are fertilisation (mineral fertiliser and liquid manure), weed control (Asulam against Rumex), harvest, transport to the farm, drying with cold air in the barn and the storage in the barn during 12 months. 
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Intensive integrated production with cold-air drying in the barn.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 538352ha intensive permanent meadows (Switzerland 2004) 
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1a708f5a-094b-3f1b-a071-593baef3773e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
